"Hannah Elber left on her fourth summons and did not come back."
"After about six months missing, her funeral was set for February 13, her birthday."
"Clytem Zhao offered Alden Thorn a teleport so he could attend."
"The service falls on a Saturday in Apex, across Anesidora from F City."
"Alden's teleport reaches Arrival Station F at ten that morning."
